---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base lang="en" alternate="datenschutz/" title="Privacy · Kilian Amrehn" description="Privacy policy for kilianamrehn.com.">
<section class="wrap legal">
  <h1 class="display">Privacy</h1>
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>Kilian Amrehn, Jülicher Str. 24, 50674 Cologne, Germany. Contact details in the <a class="u" href={import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/') + 'en/legal-notice/'}>legal notice</a>.</p>
  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>This website is served via GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., USA). When you visit, GitHub processes technically necessary data such as your IP address, the time and the page requested in server log files in order to deliver the site securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR).</p>
  <h2>No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies, uses no analytics or advertising services and loads no fonts or scripts from third parties. All fonts are hosted on the site itself.</p>
  <h2>Contact by email</h2>
  <p>If you write to me, I process your details only to answer your enquiry (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR).</p>
  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection, and the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority.</p>
  <p class="mute">The German version of this page is legally binding.</p>
</section>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal { max-width: 760px; margin: 0; padding-top: 40px; padding-bottom: 120px; }
  .legal h1 { font-size: clamp(56px, 7vw, 96px); margin-bottom: 40px; }
  .legal h2 { font-family: var(--f-mono); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 400; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mute); margin: 36px 0 8px; }
</style>
